    "category": "Multi-source dairy protein blend",
    "description": "Syntha-6 is a creamy, dessert-style blend of whey, micellar casein, milk protein and egg, with added fat and fiber. Retail labels list about 22 g of protein in roughly 190-200 calories per scoop, with about 2 g of sugar. It is more calories than a casein isolate, which makes it a fair pick for people trying to gain weight and a poor one for anyone in a deficit. Consumer Reports' October 2025 testing listed it among the better choices on lead.",
